{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.997,"lines":[{"text":"In the house of the broken, we’re reaching for healing…","t":2.18,"e":7.84,"w":[["In",2.18,2.26],["the",2.3,2.38],["house",2.42,2.7],["of",2.72,2.84],["the",2.86,2.92],["broken",2.98,3.52],["we’re",5.98,6.14],["reaching",6.22,6.66],["for",6.74,6.9],["healing",6.98,7.84]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"And the prayers of the weary, they’re finding their home.","t":11.8,"e":19.26,"w":[["And",11.8,11.9],["the",11.92,12.02],["prayers",12.1,12.62],["of",12.7,12.8],["the",12.86,12.94],["weary",13.04,13.86],["they’re",17.52,17.76],["finding",17.86,18.42],["their",18.46,18.68],["home",18.78,19.26]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Yeah…","t":52.66,"e":52.66,"w":[["Yeah",52.66,52.66]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"I see the children singing in the morning rain","t":52.68,"e":55.8,"w":[["I",52.68,52.76],["see",52.84,53.02],["the",53.06,53.16],["children",53.26,53.88],["singing",54,54.42],["in",54.5,54.62],["the",54.68,54.78],["morning",54.88,55.42],["rain",55.5,55.8]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"With empty hands but a hope in their pain","t":56.34,"e":59.22,"w":[["With",56.34,56.5],["empty",56.58,57.02],["hands",57.12,57.6],["but",57.7,57.9],["a",57.96,58.06],["hope",58.12,58.38],["in",58.44,58.54],["their",58.58,58.76],["pain",58.9,59.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"The man on the corner lifts his eyes to the sky","t":59.54,"e":62.48,"w":[["The",59.54,59.62],["man",59.72,60.12],["on",60.18,60.3],["the",60.34,60.44],["corner",60.5,60.86],["lifts",60.9,61.12],["his",61.16,61.32],["eyes",61.4,61.66],["to",61.72,61.88],["the",61.92,62.02],["sky",62.14,62.48]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Waiting for a promise that will never run dry","t":62.96,"e":65.72,"w":[["Waiting",62.96,63.3],["for",63.36,63.56],["a",63.62,63.68],["promise",63.76,64.12],["that",64.18,64.34],["will",64.38,64.52],["never",64.6,64.92],["run",65.02,65.18],["dry",65.38,65.72]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"The struggle is heavy, like a stone in the river","t":65.98,"e":68.94,"w":[["The",65.98,66.06],["struggle",66.12,66.56],["is",66.62,66.76],["heavy",66.82,67.3],["like",67.4,67.56],["a",67.62,67.7],["stone",67.78,68.2],["in",68.24,68.36],["the",68.44,68.52],["river",68.6,68.94]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"But a holy fire makes the cold heart quiver","t":69.2,"e":72.16,"w":[["But",69.2,69.3],["a",69.36,69.42],["holy",69.48,69.94],["fire",70.04,70.54],["makes",70.6,70.82],["the",70.86,70.96],["cold",71.04,71.4],["heart",71.44,71.72],["quiver",71.78,72.16]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"We build our faith up on the unshaken rock","t":72.48,"e":75.38,"w":[["We",72.48,72.6],["build",72.66,72.9],["our",72.96,73.12],["faith",73.26,73.66],["up",73.69,73.89],["on",73.72,74.02],["the",74.1,74.22],["unshaken",74.3,75],["rock",75.12,75.38]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Now we’re all standing while the stormwinds knock.","t":75.72,"e":78.78,"w":[["Now",75.72,75.88],["we’re",75.98,76.24],["all",76.28,76.46],["standing",76.62,77.02],["while",77.08,77.28],["the",77.3,77.38],["stormwinds",77.96,78.18],["knock",78.32,78.78]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh, healing river, tell me where do we go?","t":79.2,"e":84.18,"w":[["Oh",79.2,79.42],["healing",80.18,80.64],["river",80.76,81.08],["tell",81.76,82],["me",82.08,82.26],["where",82.34,83.08],["do",83.18,83.32],["we",83.42,83.7],["go",83.8,84.18]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"When the seeds of mercy are starting to grow.","t":86,"e":90.6,"w":[["When",86,86.16],["the",86.2,86.3],["seeds",86.42,86.78],["of",86.82,86.94],["mercy",87.02,87.64],["are",88.3,88.66],["starting",88.8,89.72],["to",89.82,90.12],["grow",90.18,90.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Oh, healing river, let Your echoes be loud","t":93,"e":97.24,"w":[["Oh",93,93],["healing",93.14,93.56],["river",93.66,94],["let",94.68,94.92],["Your",95.04,95.2],["echoes",95.42,96.26],["be",96.34,96.44],["loud",96.68,97.24]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Lift up these shadows, pull us out of the cloud.","t":98.9,"e":103.66,"w":[["Lift",98.9,99.16],["up",99.26,99.46],["these",99.54,99.76],["shadows",99.86,100.68],["pull",101.16,101.4],["us",101.48,101.72],["out",101.84,1